  "description": "AlterNET Scripter is a component library designed to integrate C#, Visual Basic, TypeScript, JavaScript, and Python, IronPython scripts into your WinForms and WPF .NET desktop applications. It allows extending the application logic by implementing custom functionality or automating custom tasks without recompiling and redeploying the application. \n\nThis package includes DebugCodeEdit class, WPF utility, and helper classes required for integrating Script Debugger with Code Editor.\n\nThis multi-target package can be used with .NET applications targeting .NET Framework starting from 4.6.2 or .NET 6 / .NET 7 / .NET 8\n\nMore information about Scripter can be found here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/products/scripter\n\nDocumentation and sample projects can be downloaded here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/download\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires purchasing a license for legal usage. Please refer to our licensing FAQ here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/faq#license",
